c:TimelineItem sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Tree sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Legend sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:DataGrid sem:group c:DataGroup . c:GridRow sem:group c:DataGroup . c:TimeAxis sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:JsonTree sem:group c:DataGroup . c:JsonNode sem:group c:DataGroup . c:HexView sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:BodyViewer sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Chart sem:group c:DataGroup . c:BarChart sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Heatmap sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:LineChart sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Sparkline sem:group c:DataGroup . c:SparklinePoint sem:group c:DataGroup . c:SparklineReadings sem:group c:DataGroup . c:FindingList sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Column sem:group c:DataGroup . c:series sem:group c:DataGroup . c:GridColumn sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:CellKind sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Filter sem:group c:DataGroup . c:TextFilter sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:ValueFilter sem:group c:DataGroup . c:FlagFilter sem:group c:DataGroup . c:TimeScale sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Representation sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Money sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Board sem:group c:DataGroup . c:BoardCard sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Calendar sem:group c:DataGroup . c:CalendarEntry sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:Outline sem:group c:DataGroup . c:OutlineItem sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:MessageList sem:group c:DataGroup . c:Message sem:group c:DataGroup .
c:BoardKey sem:group c:DataGroup .
# Lists an app shows its people, read from the graph: its keyboard shortcuts, and what it remembers.
c:ShortcutList sem:group c:DataGroup . c:PolicyList sem:group c:DataGroup .

# --- Navigation ---
c:Tabs sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:Tab sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:NavList sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:NavLink sem:group c:NavigationGroup .
c:Breadcrumbs sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:Pagination sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:Stepper sem:group c:NavigationGroup .
c:AppBar sem:group c:NavigationGroup . c:TabsDetachKey sem:group c:NavigationGroup .

# --- Overlays ---
c:Overlay sem:group c:OverlaysGroup . c:Dialog sem:group c:OverlaysGroup . c:Lightbox sem:group c:OverlaysGroup . c:Drawer sem:group c:OverlaysGroup .
c:Popover sem:group c:OverlaysGroup .
# The command palette, what it lists and how it groups and remembers it.
c:CommandPalette sem:group c:OverlaysGroup . c:PaletteSource sem:group c:OverlaysGroup .
c:PaletteSection sem:group c:OverlaysGroup . c:RecentRun sem:group c:OverlaysGroup .

# --- Disclosure ---
c:Accordion sem:group c:DisclosureGroup . c:AccordionItem sem:group c:DisclosureGroup .
c:Flippable sem:group c:DisclosureGroup . c:SourceBack sem:group c:DisclosureGroup .

# --- Windows ---
c:Frame sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Window sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Palette sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:Desktop sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Taskbar sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:DesktopLayout sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:Draggable sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Resizable sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Raisable sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:Restorable sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Minimizable sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Maximizable sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:Dockable sem:group c:WindowsGroup . fs:Fullscreenable sem:group c:WindowsGroup .
c:WindowState sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:Edge sem:group c:WindowsGroup . c:PointerDown sem:group c:WindowsGroup .

# --- Inspection ---
# The graph looking at itself: the SPARQL workbench and its result views, query, triples and
# stream views, the element markup inspector and its highlight, another projection's slot, the
# shapes layer's report, and the Reference (a class's ontology, the term tree and its views). Their
# parts (the result graph's key and salience; the tree's branches, sections, kinds, cards, roles
# and facets) are listed with them. General components an inspector is made of (a data grid,
# panes, payload views, a toolbar, a code editor) are in their own groups.
c:QueryWorkbench sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:RunQueryButton sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:QueryResultView sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:ResultTable sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:ResultGraph sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:ResultTurtle sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:GraphKey sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:Salience sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:QueryView sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TriplesView sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:StreamMembers sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:StreamStats sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:ElementMarkup sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:Highlight sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:ProjectionView sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:ShapeReport sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:ClassDoc sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:StallReport sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:TermTree sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TermBranch sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:TermSection sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TermOverview sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:TermAlignment sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TermKind sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:TermMembers sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TermCard sem:group c:InspectionGroup . c:TermRole sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
c:InverseFacet sem:group c:InspectionGroup .
